ite, Soto is listed as a member of the team, effective as of January 1st, 2023."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1306, "end": 1395, "text": "Industry insiders are hailing Soto's move to Swapit-Agolico as a major coup for the team."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1396, "end": 1603, "text": "\"Gabriela is an exceptional talent, and her addition to Swapit-Agolico will undoubtedly make them a force to be reckoned with in the world of cycling,\" said cycling commentator and analyst, Carlos Hernandez."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1604, "end": 1722, "text": "With Soto on their roster, Swapit-Agolico is poised to make a significant impact in the world of professional cycling."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1723, "end": 1890, "text": "As the team gears up for the upcoming season, fans and pundits alike will be watching with bated breath to see how Soto's skills will translate to success on the road."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1891, "end": 1905, "text": "**Key Facts:**"}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1907, "end": 1961, "text": "* Gabriela Soto is a professional cyclist from Mexico."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1962, "end": 2020, "text": "* Soto has joined the Mexican cycling team Swapit-Agolico."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2021, "end": 2125, "text": "* According to the UCI, Soto is listed as a member of Swapit-Agolico, effective as of January 1st, 2023."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2126, "end": 2217, "text": "* Soto's impressive track record includes a podium finish at the Tour Femenino de Colombia."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "sports team", "scope": "Gabriela Soto", "claim": "Gabriela Soto represents Penzance A.F.C.", "answer": "Penzance A.F.C.", "quote": "When she was